input.description:
Feature-specific input fields, nested here rather than at the top level of the body. The fields accepted for the feature/subfeature named in `model` are its `input_schema`, served by GET /v3/info/{feature}/{subfeature}. Examples:
- text/ai_detection: {'text': 'content to analyze'}
- ocr/ocr: {'file': '<file ID or URL>', 'language': 'en'}
- image/generation: {'text': 'prompt', 'resolution': '1024x1024'}
- translation/document_translation: {'file': '<file ID or URL>', 'target_language': 'fr'}

